rotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 268, 87, 282]}], [{"t": "Why the phasing mattered", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 14.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 289, 652, 308]}], [{"t": "Five phases over three years did more ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 317, 673, 331]}, {"t": "than spread cost; it reduced risk. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 329, 650, 343]}, {"t": "Each tranche carried forward site ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 341, 652, 355]}, {"t": "knowledge, so fewer surprises turned ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 353, 672, 367]}, {"t": "up in ceilings and risers. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 365, 605, 379]}], [{"t": "Approvals came faster because ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 389, 642, 403]}, {"t": "stakeholders already knew the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 401, 638, 415]}, {"t": "playbook. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [488, 413, 537, 427]}], [{"t": "Our ongoing work at Curtin is really about ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [73, 291, 403, 314]}, {"t": "reliability in a live environment You protect the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [73, 311, 442, 333]}, {"t": "teaching day, make changes in smart increments, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [73, 330, 465, 353]}, {"t": "and keep improving the platform the university ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [73, 349, 446, 372]}, {"t": "runs on.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#0